1223:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h **** /** \brief Configuration structure type for the Sys Pll  config.
1224:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  *   This structure must be used to configure the P, N and K2  divider dividers.
1225:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  *   Note: The K2 Divider Value in case of RAMP OSC enabled will be the Final K2 Divider Value
1226:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  *   and in case RAMP OSC is disabled, the K2 Divider value will be the initial Step Value
1227:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  *   fPLL0 = N * fIN / P * K2 * 1. 0 -> K2PREDIV = 0
1228:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  *   fPLL0 = N * fIN / P * K2 * 2. 0 -> K2PREDIV = 1
1229:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  *   fPLL0 = N * fIN / P * K2 * 1. 6 -> K2PREDIV = 2
