1402:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  * NOTE: Pre-condition to call this function is PLL should be in OFF state before configuring SYSPL
1403:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  *
1404:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  * \param[in] pllCfg Pointer to CLOCK module Configuration structure handle.
